{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":17113,\"date\":\"2026-08-22T12:24:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-22T10:24:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-music-etichettera-musica-creata-con-intelligenza-artificiale\",\"title\":\"Apple Music etichetterà la musica creata con l’intelligenza artificiale\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple Music introdurrà un’etichettatura dedicata per la musica creata con l’intelligenza artificiale, per aiutare a gestire l’aumento di contenuti generati automaticamente nello streaming.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/apple-music-made-with-ai-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-music-made-with-ai\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17095,\"date\":\"2026-08-22T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-22T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-music-etichettatura-brani-generati-ai\",\"title\":\"Apple Music: etichettatura per brani generati con AI\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple Music introdurrebbe un sistema per etichettare i brani generati con intelligenza artificiale, con l’obiettivo di rendere più trasparente l’origine dei contenuti musicali.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/apple-music-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-music\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16958,\"date\":\"2026-08-16T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-16T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-30-nuove-funzioni-iphone-siri-contestuale-foto\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: 30 nuove funzioni per iPhone, tra Siri contestuale e foto potenziate\",\"excerpt\":\"iOS 27 arriverà a settembre: ecco le principali novità per iPhone, tra Siri più contestuale, organizzazione intelligente di Safari, funzioni avanzate in Foto e nuove opzioni in Wallet, Maps e Accessibilità.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Everything-New-Your-iPhone-Can-Do-on-iOS-27-Feature-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Everything-New-Your-iPhone-Can-Do-on-iOS-27-Feature-1\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16890,\"date\":\"2026-08-11T22:50:23+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-11T20:50:23+00:00\",\"slug\":\"tvos-27-watchos-27-terze-beta-pubbliche\",\"title\":\"tvOS 27 e watchOS 27: disponibili le terze beta pubbliche\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple rilascia le terze beta pubbliche di tvOS 27 e watchOS 27, con novità su Siri AI, Smart Stack, Find My e miglioramenti per Apple TV e HomePod.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/watchos-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchos-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16672,\"date\":\"2026-08-01T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-01T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-equalizzatore-personalizzato-airpods\",\"title\":\"iOS 27 porta un equalizzatore personalizzato per AirPods\",\"excerpt\":\"Con iOS 27 arriva un equalizzatore a tre bande dedicato agli AirPods: regolazione di bassi, medi e alti direttamente nelle impostazioni, con profilo che si sincronizza anche su iPad e Mac.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/iOS-27-Beta-Hints-at-New-Apple-Product-Such-as-AirPods-Ultra-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-Beta-Hints-at-New-Apple-Product-Such-as-AirPods-Ultra-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16664,\"date\":\"2026-08-01T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-01T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"come-apple-e-cambiata-con-tim-cook-15-anni-in-numeri\",\"title\":\"Come Apple è cambiata con Tim Cook: 15 anni in numeri\",\"excerpt\":\"Dai ricavi al valore di Borsa, dalla base installata alle subscription: ecco i principali numeri che raccontano l’evoluzione di Apple negli ultimi 15 anni, tra leadership di Tim Cook e passaggio di consegne a John Ternus.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Tim-Cook-Apple-Park-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Tim-Cook-Apple-Park\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16523,\"date\":\"2026-07-26T20:28:16+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-26T18:28:16+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-occhiali-smart-privacy-wwdc-2027\",\"title\":\"Apple prepara occhiali smart con focus sulla privacy: debutto a WWDC 2027\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple starebbe pianificando la presentazione dei suoi primi occhiali smart a WWDC 2027. Il progetto punta su nuove funzioni hardware e software dedicate alla privacy, con possibile arrivo sul mercato entro fine 2027.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/Meta-Ray-Ban-Lens-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Meta-Ray-Ban-Lens\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16446,\"date\":\"2026-07-23T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-23T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"tvos-27-watchos-27-seconde-beta-pubbliche\",\"title\":\"tvOS 27 e watchOS 27: disponibili le seconde beta pubbliche\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato le seconde beta pubbliche di tvOS 27 e watchOS 27, con novità su Siri AI, Smart Stack, Find My e miglioramenti per Apple TV. In arrivo anche una beta per HomePod e HomePod mini.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/watchos-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchos-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16370,\"date\":\"2026-07-21T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-21T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"aumenti-prezzo-apple-music-icloud-plus-apple-one-iphone\",\"title\":\"Aumenti di prezzo Apple: da Apple Music a iPhone, passando per iCloud+ e Apple One\",\"excerpt\":\"Dopo gli aumenti su Mac e iPad, Apple ha ritoccato i prezzi anche di servizi come Apple Music e Apple One, iCloud+ in otto Paesi e alcuni modelli di iPhone in Giappone.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/Apple-Up-Arrow-Fearture-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Up-Arrow-Fearture\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16247,\"date\":\"2026-07-14T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-14T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"tvos-27-watchos-27-prime-beta-pubbliche-disponibili\",\"title\":\"tvOS 27 e watchOS 27: prime beta pubbliche disponibili\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple rilascia le prime beta pubbliche di tvOS 27 e watchOS 27, insieme a una beta di HomePod Software 27. Novità su Siri AI, Smart Stack, Find My e Apple Music.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/watchos-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchos-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16235,\"date\":\"2026-07-14T11:55:27+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-14T09:55:27+00:00\",\"slug\":\"come-installare-ios-27-public-beta-sul-tuo-iphone\",\"title\":\"Come installare iOS 27 Public Beta sul tuo iPhone\",\"excerpt\":\"Ecco requisiti, compatibilità e passaggi per preparare il dispositivo e installare la prima public beta di iOS 27, con backup archiviato e indicazioni per il downgrade.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/iOS-27-Install-The-Beta-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-Install-The-Beta-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15677,\"date\":\"2026-06-21T12:58:09+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-21T10:58:09+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-music-svela-gli-artisti-piu-ascoltati-di-sempre\",\"title\":\"Apple Music svela gli artisti più ascoltati di sempre\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple Music presenta per la prima volta una classifica dedicata agli artisti più ascoltati di sempre, offrendo una nuova panoramica sui nomi che hanno dominato lo streaming.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/apple-music-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-music\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15275,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:15:49+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:15:49+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-pubblica-wallpaper-playlist-video-get-ready-per-wwdc-2026\",\"title\":\"Apple pubblica wallpaper, playlist e video “Get Ready” per WWDC 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Prima dell’inizio di WWDC 2026, Apple rende disponibili una nuova wallpaper per iPhone, iPad e Mac, una playlist su Apple Music e un video “Get Ready” per prepararsi all’evento.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/WWDC-2026-Wallpaper-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"WWDC-2026-Wallpaper\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15251,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T11:30:25+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:38:36+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-glasses-lancio-tardo-2027-gurman\",\"title\":\"Apple Glasses: lancio previsto per il tardo 2027, secondo Gurman\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple punta al lancio delle sue prime smart glasses nel tardo 2027. Tra le funzioni: fotocamere ovali, stili di montatura e audio per chiamate e notifiche.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Meta-Ray-Ban-Glasses-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Meta-Ray-Ban-Glasses\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15003,\"date\":\"2026-05-20T12:30:34+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-20T09:58:24+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-sports-mondiali-2026-90-paesi\",\"title\":\"Apple Sports si aggiorna per i Mondiali 2026 e arriva in 90 Paesi\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple annuncia l’arrivo di Apple Sports in oltre 90 nuovi Paesi e l’introduzione di funzioni dedicate ai Mondiali 2026, tra cui Live Activities e Apple News.\",\"categoryName\":\"Applicazioni\",\"categorySlug\":\"applicazioni\",\"categoryId\":13,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Sports-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Sports-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14995,\"date\":\"2026-05-20T09:00:41+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-20T09:57:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"google-prime-smart-glasses-ai-arrivo-questa-stagione-anche-con-iphone\",\"title\":\"Google: prime smart glasses AI in arrivo questa stagione, anche con iPhone\",\"excerpt\":\"Google annuncia le sue prime smart glasses AI “audio”: Android XR, supporto Gemini e collaborazione con Samsung, Gentle Monster e Warby Parker. Compatibili anche con iPhone.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/google-gentle-monster-glasses-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"google-gentle-monster-glasses\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14920,\"date\":\"2026-05-16T09:30:08+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-16T09:51:38+00:00\",\"slug\":\"10-consigli-utili-iphone-funzioni-nascoste-ios-26\",\"title\":\"10 consigli utili per iPhone: funzioni nascoste in iOS 26+\",\"excerpt\":\"Scopri 10 trucchi utili per iPhone su iOS 26 o successivo: widget dalle app, cronologia luoghi in Maps, vibrazioni personalizzate e altro.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/10-Useful-iPhone-Tips-and-Tricks-Feature-2-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"10-Useful-iPhone-Tips-and-Tricks-Feature-2\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14908,\"date\":\"2026-05-15T16:30:54+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-15T06:57:03+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rallenta-espansione-f1-apple-tv-sky-rinnova-diritti-europa\",\"title\":\"Apple rallenta l’espansione F1 su Apple TV: Sky rinnova i diritti in Europa\",\"excerpt\":\"L’interesse di Apple per estendere lo streaming della Formula 1 oltre gli Stati Uniti potrebbe essersi fermato: Sky ha rinnovato i diritti in UK, Irlanda e Italia fino al 2034/2032.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/f1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"f1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14898,\"date\":\"2026-05-15T12:30:48+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-15T06:54:50+00:00\",\"slug\":\"sei-app-iphone-popolari-arrivano-su-carplay\",\"title\":\"Sei app iPhone popolari arrivano su CarPlay\",\"excerpt\":\"ChatGPT, Perplexity, Grok, Google Meet, WhatsApp e Audiomack sono tra le nuove app iPhone disponibili su CarPlay. Ecco cosa offrono.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-WWDC25-iOS-26-CarPlay-Light-mode-250609-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-WWDC25-iOS-26-CarPlay-Light-mode-250609\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14823,\"d