ione iPhone\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman (Bloomberg), Apple continua lo sviluppo di un accessorio “pendant con fotocamere” e di smart glasses con integrazione iPhone.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Second-Generation-AirTag-Feature-Purple-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Second-Generation-AirTag-Feature-Purple\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14378,\"date\":\"2026-04-24T09:10:53+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-24T07:10:53+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-airpods-pro-videocamere-ir-2026\",\"title\":\"Nuovi AirPods Pro con videocamere IR: cosa aspettarsi nel 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo indiscrezioni, Apple starebbe lavorando a una nuova variante degli AirPods Pro con piccole videocamere a infrarossi. Possibili novità su gesti, audio spaziale con Vision Pro, chip H3 e prezzi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/airpods-pro-3-glitter-blue-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-pro-3-glitter-blue\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14004,\"date\":\"2026-03-24T19:42:05+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-24T18:42:05+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-ios-26-4-ipados-26-4-playlist-playground-emoji-purchase-sharing\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia iOS 26.4 e iPadOS 26.4: Playlist Playground, emoji e novità su Purchase Sharing\",\"excerpt\":\"Disponibili via aggiornamento over-the-air, iOS 26.4 e iPadOS 26.4 intr